Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4718050,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-4718050","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:09Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4718050,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-4718050","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:09Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4718050,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4718050","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:54Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4825230","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1847286114029370","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"update","title":"1daYs Demo 2.1t Update","summary":"Hello, added new quality-of-life features and fixed a bug.New FeaturesExit Direction Arrows Added arrows indicating where you can exit the current area. Direction Arrow Toggle You can turn these arrows on or off in the options menu. Bug FixesFixed an issue that prevented players from returning to school after visiting the bus stop.Thank you!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:55:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029370","verified_at":"2026-10-21T18:38:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1843481262688017","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"announcement","title":"1daYs Demo v0.2.01t Bug Fix","summary":"Hello,We have fixed an issue where differences in how internal coordinate data was interpreted under certain Windows regional settings could cause characters and UI elements to appear in incorrect positions.If you encountered this issue while using an existing save file, we recommend starting the game again from the beginning.We would once again like to thank everyone who reported this bug.https://steamcommunity.com/app/4718050/discussions/0/582807520276632311/Thank you.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T04:47:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262688017","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1842846814454278","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"update","title":"1daYs Demo 0.2t Update","summary":"Hello! This update expands the demo's story and adds illustrations to existing cutscenes. We've also improved camera movement and the UI, and fixed various bugs.\\1. More StoryContinue the story a little further than in the previous demo. You can now play through the early part of Chapter 2.2. Cutscene IllustrationsWe've added illustrations to existing cutscenes. I'm a little shy about sharing them, but you can now see the characters in illustrated form, too.\\1. Improved Camera MovementWe've adju","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T00:20:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814454278","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1839041357033253","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"announcement","title":"4. Interactions in 1daYs","summary":"Hello!In this devlog, I’d like to introduce the basic gameplay and interaction system of 1daYs.As Minsu, players explore various locations around the school and neighborhood, talk to people, look at objects in their surroundings, and search for useful items. When Minsu approaches a character or object he can interact with, the available actions will appear in a menu.The available actions depend on the target and the current situation. Looking around to see what you can interact with is also part","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-26T05:43:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357033253","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1837955055360616","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"announcement","title":"3. The Students of Class 2-7","summary":"Hello!In this devlog, I would like to introduce the main characters of Class 2-7.I think being in the same class creates a rather unique kind of relationship. Students cannot choose which class they are assigned to, but sharing a classroom can become one of the strongest connections they form at school.Still, being classmates does not mean everyone knows each other well. Some students see each other every day but have hardly ever spoken, while even close friends may not fully understand what the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-12T05:49:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055360616","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1836506165580840","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"update","title":"1daYs Demo 0.1.78t Update","summary":"Hello!This update adds a pause feature, improves gamepad support, and fixes several bugs. \\1. Pause FeatureAdded the ability to pause the game during gameplay.When the player can control the character, the main menu will be displayed. During cutscenes or other non-interactive moments, a pause screen will be shown instead.2. Controller Vibration & Vibration OptionAdded subtle controller vibration when navigating or selecting UI elements with a gamepad.A vibration option has been added under Gamep","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-08T14:42:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165580840","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1836506165571792","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"update","title":"1daYs Demo 0.1.74t Update","summary":"Hello.I have added a new feature and fixed several known bugs. New FeatureMap NotificationsNotifications have been added to the map to help make story progression smoother.It is now easier to see if there are any missed conversations with other characters, or where new story events can be continued.A marker will appear on the map when a location has a new conversation with another character or a story event that can be progressed.The map only shows locations that are currently accessible or plac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-04T02:23:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165571792","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1836506165557648","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"announcement","title":"2. A Day That Begins on the Street","summary":"Hello.In this devlog, I’d like to introduce some of the locations that serve as the setting for 1daYs.In the previous post, I briefly talked about what kind of game 1daYs is. This time, I’d like to talk a little more about the places the player will pass through during the day.The locations I’ll be introducing this time are places you’ll also be able to visit in the demo: the front of Minsu’s house, the bus stop, and the schoolyard.These are not especially grand or unusual places within the game","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-28T05:00:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165557648","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1836506165554710","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"update","title":"1daYs Demo v0.1.624.1t Update","summary":"Hello.This update includes feature changes and bug fixes. Patch Notes1. Removed mouse movement controls.* The mouse movement control option previously available in the settings has been removed.I decided to remove it because its inconvenience and related bugs were interfering with smooth gameplay. 2. Bug Fixes* Fixed an issue where the default BGM of the destination area did not play after moving to another map.* Fixed an issue where the most recent save page was not displayed when opening the S","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T17:12:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165554710","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1836506165545363","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"update","title":"1daYs Demo 0.1.624t Update","summary":"Hello.In this update, I replaced some UI elements and fixed several bugs. Patch Notes1. Added color distinctions for autosaves and the most recent save slot on the Load screen.* Autosave: Green title banner* Most recent save: Yellow title banner* Manual save: Red title banner 2. Improved the readability of several in-game selection UI elements.* Save/Load slot selection* Item selection* Collection selection* Map selection* Main popup menu selection 3. Replaced some other UI images. 4. Fixed an i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-24T09:41:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165545363","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1835871199306372","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"update","title":"1daYs Demo 0.1.618.2t Update","summary":"Patch Notes 1. Added new languages. * Spanish, Portuguese, German, and French- You can change the language from Options > General > Language. Thank you.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-19T07:31:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199306372","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1835871199304077","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"update","title":"1daYs Demo 0.1.618t Update","summary":"1daYs Demo 0.1.618t Patch Notes ChangesUpdated the game logo.Updated the title screen.Added an auto-sort feature to the Memo page in the Diary.You can auto-sort memos by pressing the F key on the keyboard or the Y button on a gamepad.Bug FixesFixed an issue where selecting a memo with the mouse would immediately display the menu.Fixed an issue where selecting a memo with the mouse could change the order of the menu that was previously at the top.Thank you.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T12:27:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199304077","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1835871199299561","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"update","title":"1daYs Demo 0.1.617.1t Update","summary":"1daYs Demo 0.1.617.1t Patch Notes Improvements1. Adjusted camera movement while the character is moving.* Previously, the camera was corrected toward the character’s center after the character stopped moving. This correction behavior has been removed.* Instead, the camera now keeps the character more steadily centered while the character is moving.2. Adjusted how the Save and Load screens are displayed.* Save screen: Displays the page containing the most recently saved slot. * Load screen: Keeps","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-17T05:02:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199299561","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1835236783571313","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"announcement","title":"1. About 1daYs.","summary":"Hello. Today, as I begin this development diary, I’d like to introduce what kind of game 1daYs is.1daYs is a story-driven adventure game set in a small Korean neighborhood and school.Minsu, an ordinary high school student, goes through a day that seems no different from any other, yet somehow feels a little different. As he visits different places and talks to people, he ends up experiencing an unwanted but special day.What matters in this game is not only grand adventures or extraordinary incid","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-15T17:00:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783571313","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1835236783568888","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"update","title":"1daYs Demo 0.1.615.1t Update","summary":"1daYs Demo 0.1.615.1t Update 1. The game language will now be set based on your OS language when launching the game for the first time.This does not apply to users who have already set a language or launched the game in a previous version. Please select your language from the Options menu.This only applies to the currently supported languages: English, Korean, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, and Traditional Chinese.You can change the language from Settings > General > Language.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-15T02:34:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783568888","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4718050-1835236783562001","game_id":"steam-4718050","kind":"announcement","title":"The 1daYs demo is now available.","summary":"The 1daYs demo is now available.Hello, this is velupix. The demo for my first game, 1daYs, is now available.Since this is the first game I am making on my own, there may still be many rough edges, but I am working hard to make it an enjoyable experience.Please try the demo, and look forward to the full version coming in the future!Thank you.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T00:24:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783562001","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[